h a cached summary on top and a **real resizable terminal** below.\n- Runs trio work as **persistent, isolated server-side terminal sessions** over **ConPTY** (the one declared native exception, `pywinpty`), each in its own **git worktree + branch**, with a stacking/inline window manager, engine toggle (claudeâ†”gemini), cost/tokens/time rollups, grass-idea board, type-aware deliverable launch, and Ghost World Labs branding.\n\n**Constraints it holds to**\n- **Python stdlib only**, with the single declared exception of optional `pywinpty` for terminals (degrades gracefully if absent; enforced by `distro.py`'s import scan).\n- **No database, no binary formats** â€” everything stays accessible from any CLI/editor.\n\nNote: the current working tree has uncommitted changes (modified DASHBOARD/INBOX/PROJECTS/dashboard files, new `.anchor/`, `Anchor.md`, `rnd_jobs/`, `rnd_registry.json`) â€” so what's described above reflects committed state plus in-progress local edits."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45325,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3358a27-5a63-4c45-b2bb-4381cc7e121a","uuid":"4b4c5905-0233-4032-ba08-21df98a5d8c5","request_id":"req_011Cc1YweLtKugHrFA14CqFj"}
